  "fullDescription": "Add a touch of holiday magic to your creative projects with this enchanting Christmas Whimsical Fairy Clipart Collection! This set includes 37 unique digital illustrations featuring adorable fairies, festive elements, sparkling motifs, magical accents, and charming Christmas details—perfect for adding whimsical charm to any design.\n\nAll illustrations come in both PNG (transparent background) and JPG formats, neatly organized within one ZIP file for easy access. Each image is created at high resolution 300 DPI and sized at 3600 x 3600 pixels (12″ x 12″), making them ideal for both digital and print projects.\n\nUse these delightful fairy-themed Christmas cliparts for:\n\nHoliday cards & invitations\n\nScrapbooking & journals\n\nStickers & labels\n\nSublimation projects\n\nKids’ crafts & classroom printables\n\nSocial media graphics\n\nDIY decorations\n… and so much more!\n\nYou will receive:\n✔ 37 Christmas Whimsical Fairy Clipart illustrations\n✔ PNG files (transparent background)\n✔ JPG files\n✔ 300 DPI high-resolution images\n✔ 3600 x 3600 px (12×12 inches)\n✔ Delivered in one easy-to-download ZIP file\n\nBring festive magic, sparkle, and joy to your creative world with this whimsical fairy Christmas set!",
